{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/extras/imagem_1.png?t=1741313200\" />Rodobus Simulator is a simulation game that puts you in the role of a bus driver. Transport passengers, follow routes, and face challenges like traffic, weather changes, and tight schedules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude8c <strong>Realistic Driving</strong> \u2013 Well-tuned physics and authentic bus behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Detailed World</strong> \u2013 Cities realistically represented, with highways and rural roads at real scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f3 <strong>Day and Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 The environment changes according to the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather</strong> \u2013 Rain, fog, and other effects that impact driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Varied Traffic</strong> \u2013 Local vehicles represented faithfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Complete routes and progress as a bus driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop on the bus, follow your route, and enjoy the road! \ud83d\ude8d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542600?t=1741313200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/300fe72e025e956219f4f2ce54b51c26ce8ea007/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741313200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/ad031af5d557b6d8d771b5d96da5a6ae0313a59a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741313200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/ad031af5d557b6d8d771b5d96da5a6ae0313a59a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741313200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de